  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1523\"><strong data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1471\">IgG Index &gt; 0.70</strong>: Suggests <strong data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1511\">intrathecal IgG synthesis</strong>, seen in:</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1674\">\n<li data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1552\">\n<p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1552\"><strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1550\">Multiple sclerosis</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1618\">\n<p data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1618\"><strong data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1616\">Chronic CNS infections (e.g., neuro-syphilis, neuro-TB)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1674\">\n<p data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1674\"><strong data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1672\">Autoimmune diseases (e.g., SLE involving CNS)</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1818\">\n<p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1757\"><strong data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1701\">Albumin Index &gt; 9.0</strong>: Suggests <strong data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1745\">blood-CSF barrier dysfunction</strong>, seen in:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1818\">\n<li data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1818\">\n<p data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1818\"><strong data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1776\">Meningitis</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1794\">Encephalitis</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1806\">Tumors</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1818\">Trauma</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
